Eei18hd0PnjpyVUMD8aSarmQjquAxprAFH2BE"}]}]},"metadata":{"category":"stories","author":"Matt & Tom Oldfield","description":"Meet Ronaldo - Ultimate Football Hero. \n\nAs he walked up to take his spot-kick, Cristiano knew that Real would win the trophy if he scored. He had the chance to be the hero yet again.\n\nCristiano Ronaldo overcame poverty and childhood illness to become one of the best football players ever. Escaping the hot streets of Madeira, Ronaldo first proved himself as a wonder-kid at Manchester United under Sir Alex Ferguson, before becoming a legend for Real Madrid and Portugal. This is the story of how the gifted boy became a man, a team player and a legend.","previewAudio":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0051/8845/2401/files/ultimate-football-heroes-ronaldo.mp3","audioPreviewUrl":"https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/c2ac1595563a9857899a22457c1b13c0c963f359d4e88e8fb99f3d76def24d80/5XXq4iq-XBUZAY-NLSPk-217c9dqRfzxV8o-qVC6VD0.mp3","abridged":false,"accent":"UK English","copyright":"© 2017, 2018 by Matt and Tom Oldfield; ℗  2019 by Dino Books, an imprint of Bonnier Books UK; Cover Illustration by © Dan Leydon; Design by © www.envydesign.co.uk; ℗ Bonnier Books UK Cover Illustration by © Dan Leydon","maxAge":12,"minAge":6,"cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/6Z9G4XjypACtJRYz2C3fy53ttJr7044FjU4103-9SfQ"},"status":{"name":"complete","updatedAt":"2021-07-05T14:58:58.509Z"},"languages":["en"],"media":{"duration":10022,"fileSize":165208430,"hasStreams":false},"accents":["UK English"],"authors":["Matt & Tom Oldfield"],"copyrights":["© 2017, 2018 by Matt and Tom Oldfield","℗  2019 by Dino Books, an imprint of Bonnier Books UK","Cover Illustration by © Dan Leydon","Design by © www.envydesign.co.uk","℗ Bonnier Books UK Cover Illustration by © Dan Leydon"],"genres":["history-and-biography","action-and-adventure"],"narrators":["Joe Jameson"]},"cardId":"bW1Wv","createdAt":"2021-01-27T10:36:01.557Z","updatedAt":"202